18
00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:56.410 line:1% position:50% align:center size:90%
At ten thousands, zero is less than one.

19
00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:00.170 line:1% position:50% align:center size:90%
Therefore three hundred and nine thousand,
nine hundred and fifty

20
00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:04.210 line:1% position:50% align:center size:90%
