repeat the same method.

21
00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:07.180 line:1% position:50% align:center size:90%
Eighty nine thousand, nine hundred and
ninety nine comes before

22
00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:10.250 line:1% position:50% align:center size:90%
